{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "35734030",
      "title": "Working with action() Functions",
      "sourceHash": "d7413610b967fef9b018ff026b826a813576db800db07729bf7bc1a15c1cdfb9",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.64,
          "end": 6.69,
          "en": "So to add an action to this new route here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.69,
          "end": 10.77,
          "en": "we add the special action property here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.77,
          "end": 13.8,
          "en": "And just like loader, action wants a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.8,
          "end": 16.2,
          "en": "an arrow function, or a regular function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.2,
          "end": 18.09,
          "en": "that does not matter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.09,
          "end": 19.83,
          "en": "Now just as with loaders,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.83,
          "end": 22.89,
          "en": "we typically don't wanna add our action functions here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.89,
          "end": 25.2,
          "en": "in our route definitions file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.2,
          "end": 27.18,
          "en": "but instead we want to keep that code close",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.18,
          "end": 29.97,
          "en": "to the components to which it belongs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.97,
          "end": 31.2,
          "en": "So here in this case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.2,
          "end": 33.3,
          "en": "we might want to add the action function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.3,
          "end": 35.193,
          "en": "in the new event JS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.18,
          "end": 39.63,
          "en": "So here we can export a function called action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.63,
          "end": 41.91,
          "en": "The name is up to you again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.91,
          "end": 43.95,
          "en": "we can add the async keyword here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.95,
          "end": 46.173,
          "en": "if we want to use async await in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.61,
          "end": 49.98,
          "en": "And now in this action function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.98,
          "end": 52.92,
          "en": "we can send requests to the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.92,
          "end": 55.89,
          "en": "Now what's again important to understand and keep in mind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 55.89,
          "end": 58.41,
          "en": "is that we're still on the client side here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 58.41,
          "end": 60.24,
          "en": "Just as with the loader,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 60.24,
          "end": 63.21,
          "en": "this is code that executes in the browser,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.21,
          "end": 65.19,
          "en": "this is not backend code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 65.19,
          "end": 68.16,
          "en": "You can access any browser API here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 68.16,
          "end": 70.353,
          "en": "like for example, local storage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 71.4,
          "end": 74.01,
          "en": "But very often, you might wanna send a request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 74.01,
          "end": 76.8,
          "en": "with the good old fetch function again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 76.8,
          "end": 81.6,
          "en": "And here indeed, I wanna send a request to local host 8080.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 81.6,
          "end": 83.49,
          "en": "So to my dummy backend API",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 83.49,
          "end": 87.15299999999999,
          "en": "which listens on port 8080 and their slash events.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 88.32,
          "end": 91.11,
          "en": "And I actually wanna send a post request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 91.11,
          "end": 93.06,
          "en": "which we can do like that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 93.06,
          "end": 96.24000000000001,
          "en": "and add some data to the request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 96.24000000000001,
          "end": 98.43,
          "en": "And here the data I wanna send is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 98.43,
          "end": 101.13300000000001,
          "en": "that data that was submitted with the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 102.09,
          "end": 104.82,
          "en": "Now, the great thing about react-router",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 104.82,
          "end": 108,
          "en": "is that it makes handling form submissions a brace",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 108,
          "end": 110.82300000000001,
          "en": "and it helps with extracting data from that form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 111.87,
          "end": 113.7,
          "en": "For that, you should go to that form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 113.7,
          "end": 116.97,
          "en": "and make sure that all your inputs have the name attribute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 116.97,
          "end": 119.07,
          "en": "because those names will later be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 119.07,
          "end": 121.05,
          "en": "for extracting the data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 121.05,
          "end": 123.24,
          "en": "So these names here must be set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 123.24,
          "end": 125.853,
          "en": "on all your inputs and text areas.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 126.84,
          "end": 129.66,
          "en": "Next, you should replace the form element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 129.66,
          "end": 132.16,
          "en": "with the special form component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 133.05,
          "end": 135.69,
          "en": "which is provided by react-router-dom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 135.69,
          "end": 139.23,
          "en": "So you should import form from react-router-dom",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 139.23,
          "end": 142.68,
          "en": "and then replace the opening and the closing form tag",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 142.68,
          "end": 144.48,
          "en": "with that form tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 144.48,
          "end": 147.573,
          "en": "It's the same tag, but with a capital F at the beginning.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 149.91,
          "end": 153.42000000000002,
          "en": "Now this form tag will make sure that the browser default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 153.42000000000002,
          "end": 156.51,
          "en": "of sending a request to the backend will be omitted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 156.51,
          "end": 160.29,
          "en": "but it will take that request that would've been sent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 160.29,
          "end": 162.36,
          "en": "and give it to your action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 162.36,
          "end": 164.97,
          "en": "And that's pretty useful because that request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 164.97,
          "end": 167.73,
          "en": "will contain all the data that was submitted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 167.73,
          "end": 169.023,
          "en": "as part of the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 169.95,
          "end": 171.6,
          "en": "Therefore, what you should do here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 171.6,
          "end": 174.03,
          "en": "is you should add the method property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 174.03,
          "end": 176.4,
          "en": "and set this to post for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 176.4,
          "end": 180.27,
          "en": "though, this form component also supports other HTP methods",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 180.27,
          "end": 183.873,
          "en": "like delete or patch, but here I'll choose post.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 184.71,
          "end": 186.63,
          "en": "But this request and that's important,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 186.63,
          "end": 189.12,
          "en": "will not be sent to the backend automatically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 189.12,
          "end": 191.07,
          "en": "but instead to your action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 191.07,
          "end": 193.08,
          "en": "And it will include all the form data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 193.08,
          "end": 195.813,
          "en": "if you use this special form component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 197.28,
          "end": 200.97,
          "en": "Now with that back here in new event JS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 200.97,
          "end": 203.19,
          "en": "we are in this action function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 203.19,
          "end": 207.12,
          "en": "and to get hold of that request that is captured",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 207.12,
          "end": 210.75,
          "en": "by react-router and forwarded to that action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 210.75,
          "end": 212.16,
          "en": "we have to use the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 212.16,
          "end": 214.8,
          "en": "that's passed to this action function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 214.8,
          "end": 216.93,
          "en": "because just as a loader function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 216.93,
          "end": 220.65,
          "en": "the action function is executed by react-router",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 220.65,
          "end": 222.45,
          "en": "and it receives an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 222.45,
          "end": 225.3,
          "en": "that includes a couple of helpful properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 225.3,
          "end": 229.983,
          "en": "To be precise again, the request and params properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 230.91,
          "end": 233.34,
          "en": "Now this time, we're not interested in the params",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 233.34,
          "end": 237.48,
          "en": "because I have no params here when creating a new event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 237.48,
          "end": 240.21,
          "en": "but I am interested in the request object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 240.21,
          "end": 243.183,
          "en": "because that request object contains the form data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 244.08,
          "end": 246.48,
          "en": "To get hold of that forum data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 246.48,
          "end": 249.03,
          "en": "we have to call the special forum data method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 249.03,
          "end": 251.73,
          "en": "on the request object and awaited.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 251.73,
          "end": 253.47,
          "en": "That will give us a data object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 253.47,
          "end": 255.483,
          "en": "that includes this form data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 256.89,
          "end": 258.12,
          "en": "And on this data object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 258.12,
          "end": 261.33,
          "en": "we can call the get method to get access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 261.33,
          "end": 264.18,
          "en": "to the different input field values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 264.18,
          "end": 265.473,
          "en": "that were submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 266.55,
          "end": 268.32,
          "en": "To get we pass a string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 268.32,
          "end": 272.7,
          "en": "with the different identifiers of our input fields.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 272.7,
          "end": 275.55,
          "en": "So that would be the values we chose as names",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 275.55,
          "end": 280.26,
          "en": "for the input fields like title or image in my case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 280.26,
          "end": 282.75,
          "en": "So we could, for example, get the title like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 282.75,
          "end": 286.86,
          "en": "the entered title could be extracted like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 286.86,
          "end": 290.1,
          "en": "And of course that can be repeated for all the fields",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 290.1,
          "end": 294.97,
          "en": "and I will simply create an event data object here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 295.89,
          "end": 298.27,
          "en": "where I have my title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 299.58,
          "end": 303.97,
          "en": "which is set equal to the extracted title like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 305.85,
          "end": 309.81,
          "en": "where I then have my image like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 309.81,
          "end": 311.64,
          "en": "where I then also have the date",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 311.64,
          "end": 315.12,
          "en": "that was picked and submitted like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 315.12,
          "end": 319.83299999999997,
          "en": "and where I get my description like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 321,
          "end": 324.51,
          "en": "So that's how we can extract this submitted form data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 324.51,
          "end": 327.06,
          "en": "with help of that request that's forwarded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 327.06,
          "end": 331.77,
          "en": "or that's passed into this action function by react-router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 331.77,
          "end": 334.74,
          "en": "Now with that, it's this event data that should be sent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 334.74,
          "end": 339.03,
          "en": "to the backend, and we have to convert it to JSON here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 339.03,
          "end": 342.6,
          "en": "by wrapping it with JSON stringify.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 342.6,
          "end": 345.15,
          "en": "And I'll also add some extra headers where",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 345.15,
          "end": 349.65,
          "en": "I set the content type to application JSON",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 349.65,
          "end": 351.33,
          "en": "so that the data is handled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 351.33,
          "end": 353.613,
          "en": "and extracted correctly on the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 356.1,
          "end": 359.7,
          "en": "This will then me a response if we await this here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 359.7,
          "end": 361.68,
          "en": "and then we can look into this response",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 361.68,
          "end": 365.43,
          "en": "extract the return data and do whatever we need to do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 365.43,
          "end": 369.6,
          "en": "We can, for example, again, check if it's maybe not okay",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 369.6,
          "end": 373.71,
          "en": "and in that case throw an error response",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 373.71,
          "end": 376.86,
          "en": "with that built-in JSON function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 376.86,
          "end": 380.313,
          "en": "which we can get from react-router-dom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 381.27,
          "end": 383.88,
          "en": "And that would then display our error page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 383.88,
          "end": 386.4,
          "en": "if we throw an error response like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 386.4,
          "end": 390.033,
          "en": "So this works for actions just as it worked for loaders.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 391.14,
          "end": 392.67,
          "en": "So here we could then have a message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 392.67,
          "end": 395.38,
          "en": "where we say could not save event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 396.63,
          "end": 399.603,
          "en": "and set the status code maybe to 500 again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 400.8,
          "end": 403.44,
          "en": "We can always return data from an action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 403.44,
          "end": 404.88,
          "en": "and we will do so soon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 404.88,
          "end": 405.84000000000003,
          "en": "But for the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 405.84000000000003,
          "end": 408.51,
          "en": "that's the basic action code that I want to have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 408.51,
          "end": 411.69,
          "en": "for handling this submitted form and for adding a new event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 411.69,
          "end": 414.603,
